[10.461018, "o", "== The demo: npm run dev:platform runs in a second terminal. Two tasks, then the cost view of the account.\r\n"]
[15.128896, "o", "\r\n"]
[15.129448, "o", "$ npm run demo:costs --silent\r\n"]
[15.580447, "o", "== The super admin sets the unit prices (SetUnitPrice)\r\n"]
[15.613271, "o", "test/rule/1M input tokens = 3000000 -> 200\r\n"]
[15.650484, "o", "test/rule/1M output tokens = 15000000 -> 200\r\n"]
[15.699175, "o", "test/rule-check/call = 200 -> 200\r\n"]
[15.735379, "o", "test/fixed/call = 100 -> 200\r\n"]
[15.769662, "o", "launcher/-/1k seconds = 50000 -> 200\r\n"]
[15.8238, "o", "test-payment/-/call = 300000 -> 200\r\n\r\n== The owner sets a rule: refunds of $20 or less need no approval\r\n"]
[15.858409, "o", "\r\n== The owner sends: \"Please read 1 file.\" (task read-1795084813489)\r\n"]
[17.993755, "o", "GET /v1/tasks/read-1795084813489 -> done\r\n"]
[17.994165, "o", "\r\n== The owner sends: \"Please refund 15 to cust-1\" (task refund-1795084813489)\r\n"]
[20.012886, "o", "GET /v1/tasks/refund-1795084813489 -> done\r\n\r\n== GET /v1/admin/views/account as the super admin (millionths of a US dollar)\r\n"]
